   "notes": "Hull repair drone, a crab: flat wide carapace on six magnetic legs, two arms with a thin upper arm and a massive forearm (\"Popeye\") ending in hands with two fingers and a thumb, a welding torch on the right forearm, two camera eyes on stalks (no feelers), the main field thruster in the back and four gimballed field thrusters on the knees of the front and rear legs - flies like a quadcopter to a drifting part and tows it home (repair job MovingToFragment -> CapturingFragment -> towing). Agora patchwork palette, brass joints, corner castings on the carapace for the std.bay.drone4 cradle. Every moving part is its own OBJ part; skeleton and test clips in intact/assembly/rig.json.",
